  "body": "Freshly renovated inside, with room to make your mark outside, this home is a fantastic opportunity to secure your place in family-friendly Red Beach.  Set back from the road in a handy central location, it's easy to see why the current owners have loved calling this place home.\r\n\r\nTop features you'll love:\r\n\r\n- Freshly renovated interior with modern finishes\r\n- Light-filled, open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n- Easy indoor-outdoor flow to a sunny deck overlooking greenery\r\n- Fenced garden with room for children and pets to play\r\n- Great off-street parking and a position set back from the road\r\n- Scope to add your own touches with exterior painting and landscaping\r\n- Just a two-minute stroll to the local playground, with Red Beach School and the beach an easy walk away\r\n\r\nFresh inside, with potential outside:  With the interior renovations taken care of, you can move straight in and enjoy the home from day one. There's still an opportunity to add value over time, without the need to tackle a major interior renovation before moving in.\r\n\r\nIt's a great balance of modern comfort and future potential, with the freedom to put your own stamp on the property as time and budget allow.\r\n\r\nWhat the current owners have particularly loved is the lifestyle this location offers. Weekend walks, spontaneous trips to the beach and plenty of opportunities to get outdoors have all been part of everyday life here.\r\n\r\nIt's a neighbourhood that makes it easy to enjoy the Coast, whether you're raising a family, looking to simplify or just wanting to be close to everything.",
